ind":"announcement","title":"Release date announcement","summary":"Hi everyone! I have a super exciting announcement today! Within a month, the full version of Stranding Echoes will be yours. Demo is available and is participating in the ongoing Steam Next Fest that you can go check out right now!!Have fun and I’ll see you on the 23rd of next month.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:02:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041222","verified_at":"2026-10-25T06:17:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5065490-1843481262695518","game_id":"steam-5065490","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Update 0.5","summary":"Hey guys,I'd like to address the feature added and changes made in this new build.1. Added Issue text in the Echo HUD which will explain any unusual behaviour or the reason satisfaction is decreasing.2.I've changed pipe line building placement from one at a time to dynamic. Now you can left click at the starting point, hold and drag to the end point to build a complete connected pipeline. Furthermore, if a building is placed with its extension next to a existing pipeline then that pipeline will ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T14:42:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695518","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5065490-1842846814448490","game_id":"steam-5065490","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Invitation","summary":"Hi everyone,Stranding Echoes Playtest is now available. I would love to receive your feedback. If you find any bugs, please report them no matter how small they are.While we are at it, let me also announce that I made some visual changes. Mainly camera style and lighting.Older camera:Updated camera:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T06:13:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448490","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5065490-1840944183775942","game_id":"steam-5065490","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Stranding Echoes","summary":"Hey guys,Welcome to Stranding Echoes.This is a minimalist colony sim. Echoes are non corporal being and can only travel in vehicles which can catch fire and explodes at high temperature. Buildings in a similar situation shut down locking the Echoes inside. Make your choice. Plan ahead. Survive.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T06:48:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775942","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5065490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5065490":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5065490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z"},"5283740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:06Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5065490","app_id":5065490,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","erro